Workplane is host-independent. Running it requires no Bahulam account,
cloud gateway, hosted model, or telemetry endpoint.

Optional adapters depend on third-party software distributed under its own
licence and service terms. The project licence does not change those terms.
Notable cases requiring separate review before redistribution or use:

  - Apache ECharts (Apache-2.0)      packages/renderer-echarts, peer dependency
  - Remotion (source-available)      not bundled; review licence before use
  - Map / BI provider SDKs           vendor terms and entitlements apply
